The repository contains code and a trained model checkpoint only. It does not
include any imagery, map data or labels. At runtime the software fetches data
from the third-party services below; that data stays under its own terms:

- Satellite imagery: Google Maps Platform (Maps Static API). Use requires your
  own API key and is subject to the Google Maps Platform Terms of Service.
- Map data: (c) OpenStreetMap contributors, available under the Open Database
  License (ODbL), fetched through public Overpass API instances.
- Building footprints (optional): Google Open Buildings v3, licensed CC BY 4.0
  and ODbL (https://sites.research.google/open-buildings/).
